---
# Inherits the repository-wide rules, with two exceptions.
#
# MU_CHECK/MU_ASSERT expand to a fprintf() call whose result is deliberately
# ignored, which trips cert-err33-c on every single assertion. It stays enabled
# for the library itself, where an ignored return value is a real defect.
#
# readability-function-cognitive-complexity is a metric for production logic;
# a test function is legitimately a long linear sequence of assertions.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cert-err33-c,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
...
